  "historyNote": "#6879, eff 2-1-99, EXPIRED: 2-1-07 New. #8811, INTERIM, eff 2-2-07, EXPIRED: 8-1-07 New. #8958, eff 7-31-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-15 New. #10908, eff 8-8-15",
